UID:e973c8d6-0672-4034-8c22-5a442b89bb12@gds.incidentiq.com
SUMMARY:8th Grade Overnight Trip Informational Session
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270602T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270602T124500
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for a Zoom session to learn more about the go
 als\, logistics\, and highlights of the upcoming 8th Grade Outdoor Educati
 on trip. We'll share key details about the schedule\, safety\, and what st
 udents can expect\, and there will be time for Q&A at the end. This is a g
 reat opportunity to get your questions answered and hear how this experien
 ce supports student growth\, teamwork\, and connection. We hope to see you
  there!
