DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261118T213000
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 29th annual Benjamin Cooper Memorial Lecture
 . The Benjamin Cooper Memorial Lecture was established in memory of Ben Co
 oper by his close friends David Goldberg '98\, Jennifer Miller '98\, Megan
  Palmer '97\, Jacob Remes '98\, Dan Sharfman '97\, & Jessica Wolland '97. 
 Ben\, a rising senior at Georgetown Day School\, was killed in a tragic ac
 cident on August 12\, 1997. The Lecture Fund\, endowed by the Cooper-Areen
  family\, enables GDS to bring a renowned guest lecturer to the school eac
 h year
LOCATION:B201 LMS Flexible Performance Center
ORGANIZER;CN=Maria Rodriguez:mailto:mrodriguez@gds.org
