 5 Society was established to provide our School’s philanthropic leaders th
 e opportunity to express their dedication & commitment to the founding fam
 ilies’ vision\, ideals\, & principles. Members of the 1945 Society\, & tho
 se who volunteered last year to secure foundational philanthropic support 
 for the School\, will be celebrated at a reception hosted by the HoS & BoT
 .
