DESCRIPTION:Join us for our final PSA meeting of the year and kick off p
 lans for CMD 2026! \n\nNext year’s Country Market Day will take place on S
 aturday\, September 26\, 2026\, in conjunction with Sports Saturday.\n\nWh
 ether you’re a returning volunteer or new to CMD/PSA\, we would love your 
