DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T210000
DESCRIPTION:Our guests will discuss the many complexities that news orga
 nizations face in an age of stark polarization and rapid technological cha
 nge. They will explore how journalists navigate their role as watchdogs de
 spite hostility to pr\n\nModerator: Adrienne LaFrance\, Executive Editor\,
  The Atlantic\n\nFeaturing: Jeffrey Goldberg\, Editor in Chief\, The Atlan
 tic\; Meredith Kopit Levien\, President and CEO\, The New York Times Compa
 ny\; and Jennifer Griffin\, Chief National Security Correspondent\, FOX Ne
 ws Channel
LOCATION:B201 LMS Flexible Performance Center
ORGANIZER;CN=Natalie Markley:mailto:nmarkley@gds.org
END:VEVENT
