UID:15d77578-776c-42ec-9ec6-37b04270c701@gds.incidentiq.com
SUMMARY:Policy Institute Begins
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260622T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260622T160000
DESCRIPTION:The Georgetown Day School Policy Institute is an incubator f
 or activism. For four weeks each summer\, High School students from across
  the DMV learn about pressing social justice issues of global and/or natio
 nal importance by working with advocates\, engaging in direct conversation
  with policymakers\, traveling to “ground zero” cities where the focus iss
 ue is most prevalent\, and building relationships with individuals at the 
 heart of the issue.
LOCATION:Virtual #02
ORGANIZER;CN=Natalie Markley:mailto:nmarkley@gds.org
END:VEVENT
